[00:21.35]Ride through the night
{"乘夜驰骋"}
[00:24.15]Up upon a shooting star
{"乘着流星翱翔"}
[00:26.20]With you by my side
{"有你相伴身旁"}
[00:28.55]I can fly
{"我就能飞翔"}
[00:32.12]I have no fear
{"我无所畏惧"}
[00:34.15]'Cause you'll catch me when I fall
{"因我坠落时你会将我接住"}
[00:38.42]And bring me back into your arms
{"再将我拥入你怀抱"}
